contentText:
In a candid interview earlier this year that marked one of his final on-stage appearances, music industry icon Clive Davis shared with his oldest son, Fred Davis , his reflections on the Columbia artist he was closest to — and how following his mother&#8217;s advice led to his legendary career in the music industry.

